# Generated by mazapan (plugin {{ plugin }}): the Surface keyboard's path
# (the Surface Aggregator, its HID devices, and the LPSS UART it's on),
# loaded early, so it types at the disk password prompt. The GPIO pin
# controller differs between generations: whichever pinctrl_* is loaded
# when the initramfs is built, as Omarchy picks it.
MODULES+=($(awk '$1 ~ /^pinctrl_/ { print $1 }' /proc/modules) surface_aggregator surface_aggregator_registry surface_aggregator_hub surface_hid_core surface_hid surface_kbd intel_lpss_pci 8250_dw)
